>**Increase the Fortification's Max HP by 4.**
=2 Walkthrough
* Gain your mission from {n:Rasdinice}.
* Go to any fort that is controlled by San d'Oria.
* Give the correct {p:Crystal|Category:Crystal} orders - See below.
* Report back to {n:Rasdinice} to complete mission.

=2 Notes
* The {p:Campaign Arbiter|Campaign Arbiters} gives you the following information about who gets what crystal:
** Young Elvaan wearing a red hat is the blacksmith = {i:Fire Crystal|Fire Crystal|4096}
** Adorable Tarutaru with the blonde braids is laying plaster = {i:Ice Crystal|Ice Crystal|4097}
** Hume lady is a stone mason = {i:Wind Crystal|Wind Crystal|4098}
** Old coot of an Elvaan (old Elvaan) with the huge axe on his back is a carpenter = {i:Earth Crystal|Earth Crystal|4099}
** Mithra with the black robe on = {i:Lightning Crystal|Lightng. Crystal|4100}
** Sprat of a Tarutaru wearing blue = {i:Water Crystal|Water Crystal|4101}
** Young Hume lad wearing all white = {i:Light Crystal|Light Crystal|4102}
** Lady Elvaan painter using a brush = {i:Dark Crystal|Dark Crystal|4103}
* **Most times** you can determine the crystal that they need depending on what they are wearing.
* Multiple NPC's will show up, so there is no correct order to give out the crystals, just give out the ones that need to go with who is shown.
* If you take too long, the NPC will leave.
* As opposed to Steel Resolve I, the NPCs will now appeared in a scrambled order as opposed to in a certain position in line. Pay close attention. They also LEAVE, noticably faster. So, practice with the level I op, is strongly recommended!
* Must match 20 crystals to their respective workers to complete.

=2 Objective
Allied strongholds must be fortified to withstand assault by Beastman seige turrets. Travel to one of our nation's areas and oversee the construction effort.
\**Unit Requirement:** 1 member
